{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1741617,\"title\":\"Hansel & Gretel's Halloween\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"On Halloween night, six teens enter a candy-coated labyrinth from the tale of Hansel and Gretel, where a deadly Witch turns temptation into traps-and resisting the sweetest lure is their only way out.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/taNnBPN5FrJqYxsiJIqAL0KhqZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":6.3,\"voteCount\":7,\"year\":2026,\"runtime\":94,\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Fantasy\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Marcus Mallard\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":6345320,\"name\":\"Marcus Mallard\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":6384174,\"name\":\"Logan Walcher\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2618671,\"name\":\"Christy Tate\",\"character\":\"Amelia\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kAsGL6164ee4SwSENFpka7IsQ8t.jpg\"},{\"id\":5247605,\"name\":\"Griffin Edge\",\"character\":\"Hansel\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jUaLScfnxviuojD4CeRtB67gcjv.jpg\"},{\"id\":6384178,\"name\":\"Alexia Berry\",\"character\":\"Gretel\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":6080432,\"name\":\"Aubree Payne\",\"character\":\"Madison\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":6384179,\"name\":\"Nehemiah Auxer\",\"character\":\"Jacob\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5602681,\"name\":\"Madison Sein\",\"character\":\"Taylor\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":6384182,\"name\":\"Tate Skelton\",\"character\":\"Michael\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":6384184,\"name\":\"Amanda Stump\",\"character\":\"Jacob's Mom\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2848798,\"name\":\"Caroline Kelly\",\"character\":\"Allison Cooper\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":6384188,\"name\":\"Kensington Jolie Jones\",\"character\":\"Chloe\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1567605,\"title\":\"Ebenezer\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6H2N59jJW1hZEzn2ZdrMvJw5vNI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/274ahmbkJSzdmcWrWSTu9DFv5rp.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An elderly miser embarks on a supernatural journey after visits from the ghost of his former business partner and the Spirits of Christmas Past, Present, and Yet to Come force him to confront his past and fight for a second chance at happiness.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Drama\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1514026,\"title\":\"Buddy\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1BdZbNvl1SfrrX8J9X5tQzN6Ivu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sMmG82PtjK8A9rVc34gwKQtCm3A.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Inside the colorful world of \\\"It's Buddy!\\\", a group of children spend their days singing, dancing, and helping Buddy - bright orange unicorn - spread happiness. But when one child refuses to play along, Buddy is not pleased and cracks begin to appear in this seemingly perfect world.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":14836,\"title\":\"Coraline\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4jeFXQYytChdZYE9JYO7Un87IlW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hofnlIyF6bePkgQOpcuRWLvzf15.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Wandering her rambling old house in her boring new town, 11-year-old Coraline discovers a hidden door to a strangely idealized version of her life. In order to stay in the fantasy, she must make a frighteningly real sacrifice.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1232569,\"title\":\"Pinocchio: Unstrung\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hJNdizFlxOW89edX3Rzr6OliSFI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7RsPdXLDNugDIlwXPVeeprNfMx.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Influenced by a sinister Cricket and created by Geppetto, Pinocchio launches a violent crusade to carve himself into a real boy like his brother James, one piece at a time.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Fantasy\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1657630,\"title\":\"The Awakening\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AhP971WogMHbF5iKJPKi6e6oaya.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4pYKqctQvvdyhuGjiK4szH9jEv9.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An elite military unit on a mission in the South American jungle encounters a deadly supernatural force revealing an ancient presence that continues to claim anyone who dares enter its domain.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Action\",\"War\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1246049,\"title\":\"Dracula\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ykyRfv7JDofLxXLAwtLXaSuaFfM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/be5SIsRGMckO8tU9lrLcIik70Dy.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In late 15th-century Eastern Europe, Prince Vlad II’s bride is brutally murdered. As a result, he renounces God and damns Heaven itself. Cursed with eternal life, Vlad is reborn as Dracula, an immortal warlord who defies fate in a blood-soaked crusade to wrench his lost love back from death.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Fantasy\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1062722,\"title\":\"Frankenstein\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/g4JtvGlQO7DByTI6frUobqvSL3R.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hpXBJxLD2SEf8l2CspmSeiHrBKX.jpg\",\"rating\":7.6,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Dr. Victor Frankenstein, a brilliant but egotistical scientist, brings a creature to life in a monstrous experiment that ultimately leads to the undoing of both the creator and his tragic creation.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":561,\"title\":\"Constantine\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vPYgvd2MwHlxTamAOjwVQp4qs1W.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/26OvB15pqk3eiKJG8LrXDVzO7Mw.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"John Constantine has literally been to Hell and back. When he teams up with a policewoman to solve the mysterious suicide of her twin sister, their investigation takes them through the world of demons and angels that exists beneath the landscape of contemporary Los Angeles.\",\"genres\":[\"Fantasy\",\"Action\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":426063,\"title\":\"Nosferatu\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/d0B8xDdqBZlzlPEzES8lu5LlNQn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2gAStVyyv9C3BSEKhP0a1aM3Qy9.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A gothic tale of obsession between a haunted young woman and the terrifying vampire infatuated with her, causing untold horror in its wake.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1159831,\"title\":\"The Bride!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lV8YHwGkYZsm6EfIqnhaSz2avKt.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uXgWbwxmCW6XZ3ylRThk9Sqhwwq.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A lonely Frankenstein travels to 1930s Chicago to ask groundbreaking scientist Dr. Euphronious to create a companion for him. The two revive a murdered young woman and The Bride is born. But what ensues is beyond what either of them imagined.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Horror\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":917496,\"title\":\"Beetlejuice Beetlejuice\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kKgQzkUCnQmeTPkyIwHly2t6ZFI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A1dZ6faTjg0e6HYftBmEKujuXGQ.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a family tragedy, three generations of the Deetz family return home to Winter River. Still haunted by Betelgeuse, Lydia's life is turned upside down when her teenage daughter, Astrid, accidentally opens the portal to the Afterlife.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Fantasy\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":310131,\"title\":\"The Witch\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zap5hpFCWSvdWSuPGAQyjUv2wAC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zi2oYYNSSv7t44iSt5YrxHX9PYs.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1630, a farmer relocates his family to a remote plot of land on the edge of a forest where strange, unsettling things happen. With suspicion and paranoia mounting, each family member's faith, loyalty and love are tested in shocking ways.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Fantasy\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"ix27wcPrFw4\",\"name\":\"Hansel & Gretel's Halloween Exclusive Trailer (2026)\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}